WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.037 --> 00:00:14.638
"It's Delivery Day, Bot," Ringo said.

2
00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:25.163
Bot lit up. "Maybe your package came today!"

3
00:00:25.164 --> 00:00:31.772
Ringo and Bot raced down the hallway.

4
00:00:31.773 --> 00:00:36.776
They went into the cargo room.

5
00:00:36.777 --> 00:00:41.462
A worker sat at a desk.

6
00:00:41.463 --> 00:00:45.651
"Did any packages arrive today?" Ringo asked.

7
00:00:45.652 --> 00:00:49.012
The worker shook his head. "Nope.

8
00:00:49.013 --> 00:00:51.887
Nothing came yesterday either."

9
00:00:51.888 --> 00:00:56.396
"Mom sent a package weeks ago," Ringo said.

10
00:00:56.397 --> 00:00:58.393
"Where is it?"

11
00:00:58.394 --> 00:01:01.750
Lucy ran into the cargo room.

12
00:01:01.751 --> 00:01:04.213
She looked excited.

13
00:01:04.214 --> 00:01:07.585
"Did any packages arrive today?"

14
00:01:07.586 --> 00:01:10.624
Ringo shook his head.

15
00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:14.653
"Hmph!" Lucy stomped her foot.

16
00:01:14.654 --> 00:01:22.164
"I ordered new rocket sneakers weeks ago!"

17
00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:25.926
"Something's wrong," Ringo said.

18
00:01:25.927 --> 00:01:37.386
"I'll talk to Captain Nova."

19
00:01:37.387 --> 00:01:41.658
"We have a problem, Captain," Ringo said.

20
00:01:41.659 --> 00:01:44.862
"I know," Captain Nova said.

21
00:01:44.863 --> 00:01:48.206
"I was about to call you."

22
00:01:48.207 --> 00:01:53.291
"You know about the missing packages?" Ringo asked.

23
00:01:53.292 --> 00:01:56.656
"Oh, yes," Captain Nova said.

24
00:01:56.657 --> 00:02:02.171
"I'm waiting for a box of space jerky.

25
00:02:02.172 --> 00:02:06.016
But there's a bigger problem than that."

26
00:02:06.017 --> 00:02:10.106
"What's wrong?" Ringo asked.

27
00:02:10.107 --> 00:02:14.597
"The Freezies need help," Captain Nova said.

28
00:02:14.598 --> 00:02:19.008
"Planet Freeze is melting."

29
00:02:19.009 --> 00:02:22.787
"That's strange," Ringo said.

30
00:02:22.788 --> 00:02:31.259
"I'll go and check it out!"

